---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Cookie Policy — GetFOSS';
const description =
  'Learn how GetFOSS uses cookies, Google Analytics, and browser Local Storage to understand website traffic and remember your preferences.';
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalPath="/cookies/"
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-intro">
        This policy explains how GetFOSS uses cookies and similar browser
        technologies to understand website traffic and remember your
        preferences.
      </p>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: November 26, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <article class="legal-content">
      <section>
        <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
        <p>
          Cookies are small text files that websites can store in your
          browser. They are commonly used to remember preferences,
          understand website usage, and support website functionality.
        </p>
        <p>
          Similar technologies, such as browser Local Storage, can also
          store information on your device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. How GetFOSS Uses Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          GetFOSS does not use cookies for advertising, behavioral
          advertising, or cross-site advertising tracking.
        </p>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics to understand website traffic and
          improve our content. Depending on its configuration, Google
          Analytics may use cookies or similar technologies to collect
          information about visits and interactions with the website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Google Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          Google Analytics helps us understand general usage patterns,
          such as which pages are visited, how visitors arrive at the
          website, and which devices and browsers are used.
        </p>
        <p>
          Analytics information is used for statistical analysis and
          website improvement only. GetFOSS does not use this information
          to serve advertisements or sell visitor data.
        </p>
        <p>
          Google may process information collected through its services
          according to its own policies:
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Google Privacy Policy
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Theme Preference and Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
          GetFOSS uses browser Local Storage to remember your selected
          color theme. The preference is stored on your device under
          the key <code>site-palette</code>.
        </p>
        <p>
          This information allows the website to keep your preferred
          appearance between visits. It is not used for advertising
          or visitor profiling.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Managing Cookies and Stored Data</h2>
        <p>
          You can manage or delete cookies and Local Storage through
          your browser settings. Most browsers allow you to block
          cookies, remove existing cookies, or clear website data.
        </p>
        <p>
          Blocking analytics cookies may limit the information available
          to us about website traffic. Clearing Local Storage will reset
          your saved theme preference.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          Google Analytics is a third-party service. Its use of cookies
          and other technologies is governed by Google's own policies
          and configuration.
        </p>
        <p>
          GetFOSS may also link to external websites. Those websites
          may use their own cookies and tracking technologies, which
          are outside our control.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Cookie Policy when our website or use of
          cookies and similar technologies changes. The latest version
          will be published on this page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this Cookie Policy, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:info@getfoss.org">info@getfoss.org</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.25rem 6rem;
  }

  .legal-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .legal-header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .legal-intro {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .updated {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }

  .legal-content section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--line);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--text);
  }

  .legal-content code {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-page {
      padding-top: 2.75rem;
      padding-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .legal-header {
      margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    }

    .legal-content {
      gap: 1.85rem;
    }
  }
</style>
